						 <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/peak/everest-new-blue.jpg" width="1200" alt="everest-new-blue.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p><br /></p> <p>我<br /> 前往<br /> 远方<br /> 在我<br /> 休息时<br /> 去打败<br /> 那还未被<br /> 征服的峰。<br /> 她向我报以<br /> 嘲弄，她荒凉的<br /> 脸庞，冰冷的<br /> 手，和苦寒结冻的<br /> 头颅。但我将我的斧子<br /> 砍进了一个此前曾经试图<br /> 登上山巅的男人的肋骨，<br /> 然后我终于抵达她的最高点。<br /> 我稳住重心，伸手触摸<br /> 绝顶，咧嘴狂喜以至不能自已。<br /> 正当我大笑时，我向下抛去<br /> 一瞥，看见脚下山峦之间<br /> 色彩鲜艳的夹克衫，<br /> 帽子，以及冰爪。<br /> 他们都俯卧如同<br /> 红色斑块。她<br /> 咆哮着，卷起<br /> 疾风，刮过<br /> 我的眼前，<br /> 而我跌落，<br /> 不停下坠。<br /> 在此，我<br /> 能看见。<br /> 现在她<br /> 长了<br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5140">2ft</a>。</p> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/peak/climber.jpg" width="1200" alt="climber.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p><br /></p> <div class="licensebox22"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;授权&nbsp;/&nbsp;引用</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;隐藏授权&nbsp;/&nbsp;引用</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>请按如下方式引用此页：</p> <p>更多详情请参阅<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/licensing-guide">授权指南</a>。<br /> <strong>授权信息</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>文件名：</strong>everest-new-blue.jpg<br /> <strong>图像名：</strong>File:Sunny Everest.JPG<br /> <strong>图像作者：</strong>Anju Sherpa, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elogee-fishtruck" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4037075&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607802983" alt="Elogee FishTruck" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4037075)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elogee-fishtruck" >Elogee FishTruck</a></span><br /> <strong>授权协议：</strong>CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>来源链接：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/peak">SCP Foundation Wiki</a><br /> <strong>衍生自：</strong><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunny_Everest.JPG">Wikimedia Commons</a><br /> <strong>备注：</strong>裁剪，水平翻转，以及变换为蓝色</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>文件名：</strong>climber.jpg<br /> <strong>图像名：</strong>File:Green Boots.jpg<br /> <strong>图像作者：</strong>Maxwelljo40, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elogee-fishtruck" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4037075&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607802983" alt="Elogee FishTruck" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4037075)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elogee-fishtruck" >Elogee FishTruck</a></span><br /> <strong>授权协议：</strong>CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>来源链接：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/peak">SCP Foundation Wiki</a><br /> <strong>衍生自：</strong><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Green_Boots.jpg">Wikimedia Commons</a><br /> <strong>备注：</strong>裁剪</p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>更多维基文档信息，请见<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">版权信息总览</a>。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eurya" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4369343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607802984" alt="Eurya" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4369343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eurya" >Eurya</a></span></p> 
